  "details": "It seems like physbones doesn't follow along perfectly, even when is animated is enabled and immobile is 1. This has historically worked without any problems, but it seems like it's a thing now. I don't think there has been a recent update to physbones. \n\nIt most noticeable when the arm extends fully and is about to go fully straight, as seen in the video I attached.\n\nAvatar is: avtr_e08d3526-c73b-4947-ae1a-331fe55e9e07\n\nVideo showing problem: https://youtu.be/VagN7AQe1bQ\n\nAnd yes, I'm aware of this. -> https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-dynamics/physbones/#humanoid-bones",
